# Allowlist: ship only what the browser needs. Everything at the repo root is
# ignored unless re-included below, so new notes, briefs or scripts never go public
# by accident. Add new runtime files/folders here.
/*
!index.html
!404.html
!*.js
!*.css
!sources.json
!site.webmanifest
!robots.txt
!sitemap.xml
!favicon.ico
!apple-touch-icon.png
!vercel.json
!assets

# Belt and braces: never ship internal folders even if a rule above changes
tools
docs
.claude
*.md

# Inside assets/: source sheets and docs that the game never loads
assets/**/*.md
assets/characters/character-sheet.jpg
assets/ui/_sheet.jpg
